      "content": "thanks. i'll try the foliar spray idea. one more thing—i've noticed some weird, patchy spots in the soil where the plants aren't growing at all, almost like the nutrients just vanish in those specific holes. is that just a soil compaction issue or could there be something else affecting the microbial activity down there?",
